<title>NETHERLANDS: ARTU 96/97 1ST HALF GROSS LOSS RISES.</title>
<headline>ARTU 96/97 1ST HALF GROSS LOSS RISES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996/1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Gross loss (guilders)	    228,000 vs 88,000</p>
<p>    Turnover				   4.5 vs 3.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Anti-allergy medicine maker Artu Biologicals NV gave</p>
<p>no net profit or loss figures in its half-year statement. It</p>
<p>said it traditionally realises its profits in the second half of</p>
<p>the year.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
